<%# The head of the open notification in the lane: the link to the ticket's
    full view, then the actions on the notification in words ("Als gelesen" /
    "Als ungelesen", "Archivieren"; archived: "Zurück in die Inbox"), the same
    as in the "···" menu of its row (_notification_actions). Archiving keeps
    the ticket open here, the row leaves the list, no jump to the next one.
    The buttons share one form (F2: same height, same light edge): neither is
    the main action of the lane.
    Stable id "inbox_pane_status_pills": a state change swaps only this
    small area, never the whole lane (an open reply form would be lost).
    Locals: notification, current_organisation, project, ticket. %>
<div id="inbox_pane_status_pills" class="inbox-lane-actions">
  <%= link_to organisation_project_ticket_path(current_organisation, project, ticket),
              target: '_top', class: 'inbox-lane-actions__open' do %>
    <%= t('views.organisations.notifications.pane.open_full_view') %>
    <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i>
  <% end %>
  <%= render 'organisations/notifications/notification_actions',
             notification: notification, button_class: 'inbox-lane-actions__button', icons: true %>
</div>
